description:
Design a 3-to-8 decoder with an enable input. When the enable signal is active, it decodes the 3-bit input (`i_data_in`) and generates a specific 8-bit output (`decoder_out`), where each input value corresponds to a unique output value in reverse order (0 maps to 7, 1 maps to 6, and so on). If the enable signal is not active, the output remains unchanged.
module top_module(
   input    		[2:0]    i_data_in,             
   input             		i_data_in_en,          
   output reg  	[7:0]    decoder_out            

 );

